   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZCTU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Zimbabwe. The main outcome areas it contributes to are advancing equality and workers rights  building new alliances and pushing progressive politics but also opposing the backlash  increasing gender equality. The main rights holders are women in the trade union. Through trainings, seminars, workshops and organising the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
